**/.DS_Store
**/.idea/**
**/bin/**
**/capture/**
**/data/**
**/plugins/**
**/saves/**
**/settings/**
**/sounds/**
**/obj/**
**/design/**

# Bundled engine defaults (leader/event/improvement art + data) are embedded into the SDL
# build and MUST be tracked, even though they live under a data/ directory the rule above
# ignores. Without this, newly-added art is silently dropped from commits — and from any
# machine that pulls — producing missing images at runtime.
!runtime/sdl/Resources/defaults/data/**
